    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "This value defaults to [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false), which means that Live Photo capture resumes when the session stops.",
      "ko": "이 값의 기본값은 [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false)입니다. 이는 세션이 중지될 때 Live Photo 캡처가 다시 시작됨을 의미합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "13968a41021dbd799ad9eaae1e8db75ec013490e7a5e9043b09d636d8dfc32d7",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "Set the value to [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true) to save the state of the [`isLivePhotoCaptureSuspended`](avcapturephotooutput/islivephotocapturesuspended.md) property across session restarts.",
      "ko": "세션이 재시작될 때 [`isLivePhotoCaptureSuspended`](avcapturephotooutput/islivephotocapturesuspended.md) 속성의 상태를 저장하려면 이 값을 [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true)로 설정합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "b0b49ac134da0441f32d515356757b6dfd44edb47372db2775458adb85df0330",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
